<span id="S4.T2.6.1.20.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:34.1pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.6.1.20.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">57.64(0.31)</span>
</span></td>
