<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>The distribution of <span id="A3.F10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">culture-general</span> neurons in Falcon3-10B-Instruct.</figcaption>
</figure>
